      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "うちの武器屋は腕利きの職人が揃っててね、\n商品は、切れ味も、使いやすさも折り紙付きさ！\n口ではなんとでも言える？　嘘なもんか。\n試しに剣を一振りやるよ。店に来てくれ。",
        "official_en": "At our armory, we guarantee blades that are as sharp\nas they are balanced! But don't just take our word for\nit! Stop by and our expert artisans will let you swing\nblades around until we find the perfect one for you!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
