      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "店に来てくれて感謝だよ！　これはうちの木刀さ。\n作りには自信がある。使い心地を確かめてくれ。\nこれから品揃えもたくさん増えていく予定さ。\nまたちょくちょくのぞきに来ておくれよ。",
        "official_en": "Thanks for swinging by! This, here, is one of our\nsignature reliable weapons, a wooden sword! Feels\nsturdy, right? We'll keep increasing our product\nlineup, so make sure to check back again soon.",
